[49.09446, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[3J\r\n  ROUTE INSTALLATION PATH\r\n  =======================\r\n\r\n  request bgp rib inject\r\n      -> BGP best path\r\n      -> system RIB\r\n      -> Linux kernel FIB\r\n\r\n  The automated validator also withdrew the prefix and proved kernel removal.\r\n  Control-plane and kernel state came from the running system.\r\n\r\n  Recording complete.\r\n\u001b[?2004h$ "]
